(label "GND" (at 680.7199999999999 419.1 0) (effects (font (size .8 .8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 4607330d-545e-40e7-a6a8-e9dba5e0cf54))(text "5V regulated centre-positive barrel only. Q1 protects reverse polarity, NOT overvoltage.\nUSB-C: Adafruit4056 panel extension to Pico USB socket; VBUS NOT tied to V5.\nCore J4 pins2 and7 NC. Core power uses separate 5V Berg cable;12V position NC.\nAccessory is custom3V3 SPI only, not UEXT/RS232/5V bus. Active Next adapter pending.\nPin-map study: passive symbols; ERC is not electrical validation. Routing, ESD, host power-off and firmware pending. 2A input fuse, 0.6A maximum LED allocation." (at 35 535 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid 4542871a-f06f-49af-ad11-6a925c59662f))(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))